    "Mikrofon izni olmadan kayıt alınamaz. Ayarlar › AuraVoice üzerinden açabilirsin.": {
      "comment": "Mikrofon reddedilince cikan uyari govdesi (errorMessage; zaten String(localized:))",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يمكن التسجيل دون إذن الميكروفون. يمكنك تفعيله من الإعدادات › AuraVoice."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "মাইক্রোফোনের অনুমতি ছাড়া রেকর্ডিং করা যায় না। সেটিংস › AuraVoice থেকে চালু করতে পারেন।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording isn't possible without microphone access. You can turn it on in Settings › AuraVoice."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sin acceso al micrófono no se puede grabar. Puedes activarlo en Ajustes › AuraVoice."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible d’enregistrer sans l’autorisation du micro. Vous pouvez l’activer dans Réglages › AuraVoice."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "माइक्रोफ़ोन की अनुमति के बिना रिकॉर्डिंग नहीं हो सकती। सेटिंग्ज़ › AuraVoice से इसे चालू करें।"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mikrofon izni olmadan kayıt alınamaz. Ayarlar › AuraVoice üzerinden açabilirsin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有麦克风权限就无法录音。可以在“设置” › AuraVoice 中开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mikrofon izni verilmedi. Ayarlar › AuraVoice üzerinden açabilirsin.": {
      "comment": "Hata metni. Anahtarda '›' ve marka adi 'AuraVoice' var; 'Ayarlar' iOS Ayarlar uygulamasinin adi oldugu icin cevirmen notu sart (ar icin yon isareti de ters cevrilmeli).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يتم منح إذن الميكروفون. يمكنك تفعيله من الإعدادات › AuraVoice."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "মাইক্রোফোনের অনুমতি দেওয়া হয়নি। সেটিংস › AuraVoice থেকে চালু করতে পারেন।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microphone access wasn't granted. You can turn it on in Settings › AuraVoice."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se ha concedido el permiso del micrófono. Puedes activarlo en Ajustes › AuraVoice."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisation du micro non accordée. Vous pouvez l’activer dans Réglages › AuraVoice."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "माइक्रोफ़ोन की अनुमति नहीं मिली। सेटिंग्ज़ › AuraVoice से इसे चालू करें।"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mikrofon izni verilmedi. Ayarlar › AuraVoice üzerinden açabilirsin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未授予麦克风权限。可以在“设置” › AuraVoice 中开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
